-- PREP ONLY. DO NOT APPLY DURING FEATURE FREEZE.
-- Mission #18 post-freeze implementation blueprint.
-- Re-check live schema + Operating Manual before activation.

-- Canonical exact proof target:
-- https://example.com/
-- Same-host HTTPS redirects are allowed up to 3, but a redirect is not required for success.

-- Expected Production objects after Stabilization Exit:
--   pm_internet_transport_proof_bounded_unlock_v1(uuid)
--   pm_internet_create_command_bound_pilot_grant_v1(uuid)
--   pm_internet_transport_proof_reserve_request_v1(uuid,uuid)
--   pm_internet_transport_proof_finalize_request_v1(uuid,text,jsonb)

-- Common Owner command invariant:
-- verification_state='VERIFIED'
-- command_type='GRANT_CAPABILITY'
-- action_scope='PUBLIC_READ'
-- expires_at > now()
-- signature_algorithm='WEBAUTHN_ASSERTION_VERIFIED_SERVER_SIDE'
-- auth_age_seconds <= 60
-- canonical_payload.activation_scope='TRANSPORT_PROOF_SINGLE_REQUEST'
-- canonical_payload.transport_proof_target_url='https://example.com/'
-- canonical_payload.transport_proof_max_requests=1
-- canonical_payload.authorize_owner_lockdown_release_for_transport_proof_only=true
-- canonical_payload.owner_lockdown_release_max_seconds <=120
-- canonical_payload.general_production_network_authorized=false
-- consumed nonce + allowed Owner gateway audit must match exact command.
-- Never accept caller-supplied signature_verified as authority.

-- 1) BOUNDED UNLOCK
-- SECURITY DEFINER; service_role only; exact VERIFIED v3 command.
-- Lock gateway row FOR UPDATE, re-check Stabilization Exit + Owner intent,
-- require production_network_enabled=false, set only proof-scoped owner_lockdown_active=false,
-- write source_command_id + unlock_expires_at <=120s.
-- Approval endpoint itself must NOT unlock, create grant, enable lane, or enable network.

-- 2) COMMAND-BOUND PILOT GRANT
-- SECURITY DEFINER; service_role only; exact same command.
-- PAOJAI_OPERATIONS_AI / PUBLIC_READ / LOW / can_delegate=false / <=10 minutes.
-- allowed_resources.fixed_target_url must equal exactly https://example.com/ and explicit false flags for
-- credentials/download/code_execution/external_side_effects/protected_data_egress/cross_client_context.
-- Duplicate-check source_command_id; no second live grant.

-- 3) ATOMIC ONE-REQUEST RESERVATION
-- SECURITY DEFINER; service_role only.
-- Input request_token + command_id.
-- One atomic conditional mutation, request-token unique ledger, max_requests=1,
-- reservation before DNS/network, NO AUTORELEASE after acquisition.
-- FAIL_CLOSED_CONSUME_ON_RESERVATION_NO_AUTORELEASE: any failed attempt still consumes the slot.

-- 4) IDEMPOTENT FINALIZE
-- SECURITY DEFINER; service_role only.
-- Finalize request token once; duplicate finalize returns existing terminal outcome.
-- Never decrement consumed slot or reopen lane.
-- Persist DNS/connect-time/redirect/runtime evidence only from direct executor evidence.
-- Always disable proof lane, relock Owner gateway, keep production_network_enabled=false,
-- revoke/expire exact command-bound grant, audit outcome.

-- 5) ATTESTED EXECUTOR PROMOTION
-- Separate proof-only executor artifact, verify_jwt=true, reviewed exact bytes + SHA-256.
-- Promotion verifier must fully pass before bounded grant creation.
-- Executor enforces TLS hostname verification, pinned public IP, DNS revalidation, same-host HTTPS redirects <=3,
-- timeout <=10s, response <=1MiB, no credentials/client/protected data, no side effects.

-- 6) SEPARATE PROOF-ONLY NETWORK ARTIFACT
-- Network-capable code remains isolated from general Production network authority.
-- It can execute only after exact command, bounded unlock, exact bounded grant, activation gate, and atomic reservation.
-- General production_network_enabled remains false throughout.

-- TARGET BINDING MUST BE ATOMIC ACROSS:
-- lane.fixed_target_url = 'https://example.com/'
-- Owner Passkey canonical payload
-- activation gate exact-target comparison
-- verified-command helper exact-target comparison
-- bounded grant allowed_resources.fixed_target_url
-- reservation exact-target check
-- proof executor TARGET
-- artifact attestation/hash/review
-- Mission Control readiness display/tests
-- No aliases, wildcards, caller-supplied URLs, or cross-host redirects.

-- PRIVILEGES
-- REVOKE ALL FROM PUBLIC, anon, authenticated for all mutation functions.
-- GRANT EXECUTE only to service_role.

-- POST-APPLY MANDATORY CHECKS AFTER EACH IMPLEMENTATION STEP
-- implementation contract validation
-- authority-surface regression
-- Central / Action / Guardian Safety Regression
-- concurrency readiness + failed-request-slot policy
-- Recovery/Kill-Switch regression
-- runtime concurrency harness as soon as Production atomic reservation exists: exactly one winner, zero DNS/network side effect.
-- no real network request until all technical gates pass and fresh Owner Passkey is verified.
